{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2022-06-14 12:05:00', 'title': 'CATERPILLAR TO RELOCATE GLOBAL HEADQUARTERS TO DALLAS-FORT WORTH AREA', 'text': "DEERFIELD, ILL. , JUNE 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CATERPILLAR INC. (NYSE: CAT) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL MOVE ITS GLOBAL HEADQUARTERS TO THE COMPANY'S EXISTING OFFICE IN IRVING, TEXAS, FROM ITS CURRENT LOCATION IN DEERFIELD, ILLINOIS."}